coremeta4cat:CAT_32x1-99x6_all dcterms:description "Pd catalysts (nominal 2 wt% Pd) with 0-5 wt% nominal phosphorus loading on Al2O3 (6 samples) and SiO2 (4 samples) supports. See used_catalyst under is_about_activity and evaluated_entity under was_generated_by above for per-sample detail (ICP-AES loading, BET surface area)." ;
	dcterms:title "10 Pd/P catalyst samples (Al2O3 and SiO2 supports)" ;
	a prov:Entity .
