coremeta4cat:CHAR_32x1-99x6_PXRD dcterms:description "Powder X-ray diffraction for phase identification of all 10 Pd/P-Al2O3 and Pd/P-SiO2 catalysts, plus a P/SiO2 support-only reference sample without Pd (file PXRD_1PSiO2.xy). Two-theta range ~2-92 degrees, step size 0.015 degrees (most files); two files (nominal 5 wt% P samples) cover a shorter range ~2-63.5 degrees." ;
