	dcterms:description "Selective hydrogenation of citral over 3 Pd/P/Al2O3 catalysts (1, 3, 5 wt% nominal P loading, ~2 wt% Pd) in a full factorial design (9 runs) exploring temperature, pressure, phosphorus loading, and time. Conversion ranged 15-85%, yield 15-65% across the 9-run design (catalytic_data.xlsx, 'Pd-XPAl2O3_FF_Citral')." ;
